Description: avformat/hevcdec: probe streams with layers above the base layer
 .
 hevc_probe() scored a stream 0 as soon as it met a NAL unit header
 whose nuh_layer_id was not 0, as the value was reserved in the first
 version of H.265. Since version 2 nuh_layer_id is 0 for the base layer
 and up to 62 for the layers of multilayer streams, and 63 is reserved
 (H.265 V11 7.4.2.2). A raw stream with a NAL unit of a layer above the
 base layer in the probed bytes, such as the alpha layer of an x265
 --alpha stream, could not be opened without -f hevc.
 .
 Reject only the forbidden zero bit and the value 63, and count only
 the NAL units of the base layer, so that a stream is still recognised
 by the VPS, SPS, PPS and IRAP picture of its base layer.
 .
